category: Utils
requires: perl perl-libwww-perl perl_base perl-libwww-perl
sdesc: "Retrieve certificate revocation lists (CRLs)"
ldesc: "The fetch-crl utility will retrieve certificate revocation lists (CRLs) for a
set of installed trust anchors, based on crl_url files or IGTF-style info
files. It will install these for use with OpenSSL, NSS or third-party tools."

